{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるお店で泳いでる金魚。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近づいたら水から顔を出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口をぱくぱくしながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちまで泳いでくるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い日が続いてますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は雨も雷もすごかったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空が騒がしいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"化粧下手なのまいやんにバレた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眉毛かくの失敗してその状態で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんにチェックしてもらった話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をメイクさんに聞いたんだって笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3本眉毛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枝毛眉毛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんに教えてもらう！うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい会いに行ったら、\nまりっかと仲良くなれますか？^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くなりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいお話したいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーミンのキャラクターで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニョロニョロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のﾒﾝﾊﾞｰは、生ｸﾘｰﾑ嬉しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってますが\nまりっかはどうでした？\n嬉しかったですか－？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねー後にみんなと合流してから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイテンションになって楽しかった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日サプライズとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してもらったことありますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー♪嬉しいよねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真の苔に名前って付けてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニョキ子ニョキ男ニョキ美だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニョキ子とニョキ男に芽がでたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声だけの演技に興味ある？\nあるなら、どんな人物、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラクター演じてみたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい興味あります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫の朗読も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvのナレーションも楽しかったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか声優にも挑戦したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなキャラクターが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合ってると思いますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルとテスト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちが大変だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんじゃーこの質問笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変でも楽しいか楽しくないかで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ったらプリンシパルのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"断然楽しいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の星から\n曲調も歌詞も今までの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にない感じですごい好き！！！\n良かったらまりかの歌ってるパート\n教えてーなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪飯田橋の〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪(通り過ぎる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪誰もが同じ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ああそれより〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪変化は嫌い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪サビ(初対面)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちかと言うと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握と個握どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はミニライブがあるからすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握も楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんとおしゃべりするの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからどっちもすきなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツ On y vua"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レースサロペット Auntie Roza"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴 usedマーチン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このサロペット、見にくいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜんぶレースなんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーから好評なの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴は最近買ったー厚底でかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子に私服載せてって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/08/9213353/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でゅふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は東京ドームで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「東北楽天ゴールデンイーグルス vs 北海道日本ハムファイターズ」戦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールを披露します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気いっぱい踊るぞー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}